<h1>Ciera Whitaker</h1>
<p>6th Police District Council, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions for reelection; on the Chicago Board of Elections candidate list as of Oct. 30, 2026. Her council biography says she focuses on public safety, accountability, and relationships between residents and police, and serves as the council&#39;s community engagement liaison. No campaign website found.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>6th District Council member; spent 16 years with the South Shore Chamber of Commerce, including as program director, and founded the consulting firm New Wave Strategy.</p>
